// Exact finite synthetic kernel for path-conditioned partial identification D8.
//
// The witness separates scalar observation, latent state, identified set,
// approximation class, ordered history, missingness, causal authority, and
// clinical interpretation. Public receipts are runtime-revalidated but remain
// unsealed model artifacts, not empirical or clinical authority.
// This is bounded runtime fixture evidence, not a proof-assistant theorem.
// Base-31 fingerprints and checksums are diagnostic, noninjective in general,
// noncryptographic, and never parsed to recover identity or grant authority.
// False authority fields are audit metadata; nominal capability types remain
// separate and no constructor promotes a D8 receipt into one.

use epistemic::proof_carrying_rebracketing_protocol::{
    LocalRebracketingEqualityDecisionReceipt,
}

